025590/extras/e05b85b5d41e1c933b5b2741d56ebdf6.poster.avif?t=1750350718\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025590/extras/e05b85b5d41e1c933b5b2741d56ebdf6.webm?t=1750350718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025590/extras/e05b85b5d41e1c933b5b2741d56ebdf6.mp4?t=1750350718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic World of TRON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the neon-lit streets of the Arq Grid on foot or Light Cycle, and navigate your way through the intriguing \u2013 often dangerous \u2013 characters that inhabit this high-stakes world. Travel through a diverse Grid filled with intriguing stories within a budding revolution all set to an immersive soundtrack from composer Dan Le Sac (TRON: Identity).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a fan of Disney\u2019s TRON, get ready to step into the universe you love like never before. If you\u2019re new to this story, prepare for a thrilling adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now\u2026 Finish the Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025590/extras/d4d62a58e88870157250bc5de1fa6655.poster.avif?t=1750350718\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025590/extras/d4d62a58e88870157250bc5de1fa6655.webm?t=1750350718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025590/extras/d4d62a58e88870157250bc5de1fa6655.mp4?t=1750350718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The Arq Grid stands on the brink of collapse. With your Identity Disc and Light Cycle, fight to escape by wielding the power of the Glitch loop. Electrifying action and a rich story combine in a new adventure set within Disney\u2019s iconic TRON universe.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cI love TRON, something that I didn\u2019t really think was still the case until I played TRON: Catalyst.\u201d<br>Paste Magazine<br><br>\u201cIf you're a fan of the franchise, then TRON: Catalyst is a title you won\u2019t want to miss.\u201d<br>Push Square<br><br>\u201cA smart and inventive RPG-lite, and a worthy entry in the TRON canon.\u201d<br>Eurogamer<br>",
